              Family trips, bike rides, vacation rentals, resort stays, golf, river days,
              easy outdoor access, and relaxed Central Oregon vacations.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Local Feel</h3>
            <p>
              More vacation-oriented than Bend, with a slower pace, lots of bike paths,
              family activities, and repeat visitors who come back every year.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Good To Know</h3>
            <p>
              Sunriver is spread out. Bikes are often one of the best ways to get around,
              especially during busy summer weekends.
            </p>
          </div>
