              Shops, restaurants, coffee, activities, rentals, and one of the main visitor
              hubs in Sunriver.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Sunriver Resort Area</h3>
            <p>
              Lodging, golf, dining, events, and resort amenities that anchor much of
              the Sunriver experience.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Deschutes River Area</h3>
            <p>
              River access, floating, paddling, wildlife, and slower outdoor time close
              to Sunriver.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>La Pine Nearby</h3>
            <p>
              Useful for river access, parks, camping, services, and exploring farther
              south in Central Oregon.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Bend Nearby</h3>
            <p>
              Bend is close enough for restaurants, breweries, shopping, events, and
              bigger-city services during a Sunriver stay.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card">
            <h3>Newberry Area</h3>
            <p>
              Lava lands, lakes, scenic drives, volcanic landscapes, and outdoor trips
              southeast of Sunriver.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2>Nearby Places From Sunriver</h2>
        <p>
          Sunriver is a useful base for exploring the south side of Central Oregon and
          the Cascade Lakes area.
        </p>

