      <section class="section">
        <h2>Staying in Sunriver</h2>
        <p>
          Sunriver works especially well for multi-day stays. Vacation rentals, resort
          lodging, bike paths, family activities, and easy outdoor access make it simpler
          for groups and families who want a home base instead of a hotel-only trip.
        </p>

        <p>
          The tradeoff is that Sunriver can feel busy and vacation-heavy during peak
          seasons. But for many visitors, that is exactly the appeal: an easy Central
          Oregon base where the days can be active without feeling complicated.
        </p>
      </section>
